STATEMENT OF CHANGES (2026), by Dmitrii Fedorov

Compared with commit 0ace0ab, this version:
- removes 35 files: modules unreachable from src/index.ts, tests that covered
  only those modules or no repository code, and 9 unused npm dependencies;
- no longer overwrites project files, and sets up only empty directories on
  its own;
- keeps task text local unless M7_ALLOW_REMOTE_CLASSIFICATION=true;
- checks file paths for containment, secret names and symbolic links, and
  marks peer text as untrusted;
- binds the visualizer and the mesh relay to loopback by default, and checks
  Host and Origin in the visualizer;
- reads .env only from the install directory;
- prefers M7_PROJECT_PATH over the Cursor activity scan;
- sends no temperature to Opus models, fixes task folder paths, and changes
  the installer so it merges its MCP client entry and writes no keys;
- raises dependency versions and rewrites the documentation for this fork.
Details and what stays open: SECURITY.md and CHANGELOG.md.

Each modified source or text file says so in its first lines. 62 files were
modified and 25 added. These cannot carry a comment and are changed too:
  mcp.json
  package-lock.json
  package.json
  tests/fixtures/tools-base-3.22.2.json
